#Query
 -DELETE FROM mytable
 - WHERE condition;
* (If you leave out where clause, then whole table will be deleted)

##Practice-Q-1
This dataset is getting too big.
Let's remove all the movies released before 2005

- DELETE FROM Movies
- WHERE year < 2005;

##Practice-Q-2
Andrew Stanton has also left the studio, so remove all the movies directed by him

- DELETE FROM Movies
- WHERE Director= "Andrew Stanton";
